# The pinned Verilator: the reference of every simulation result in CI
# (behavior tests, the differential test, mutation testing, the book).
#
# This file is the one place the version is defined (ADR-0107, "Hakem
# sürümü"; #145). The CI action .github/actions/verilator copies Verilator
# out of this exact image and fails a job whose `verilator --version` is
# not this release. The Docker backend (crates/volt-tools/src/docker.rs,
# SIMULATION_IMAGE) runs the same image; crates/volt-tools/tests/
# verilator_pin_tests.rs fails when the two differ.
#
# A release, never a development build. Changing it is a pull request of
# its own, and it passes the canary test
# (crates/volt-driver/tests/verilator_canary_tests.rs).
#
# Plain KEY=value lines: read by bash (`source`) and by the Rust test.
VERILATOR_VERSION=5.052
VERILATOR_IMAGE=verilator/verilator:v5.052
VERILATOR_DIGEST=sha256:a5b73e2fce0b2c483396f3800940f33b6faa802331a061c21694dd27b7352120
